    <node id="18 U.S.C. §2258A">
      <data key="d0">18 U.S.C. §2258A</data>
      <data key="d1">regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">18 U.S.C. §2258A is a US legislation imposing mandatory reporting obligations for child sexual abuse content.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bddbca1d37abd901742b0ca6610124c1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
